// 오른쪽 카드는 비밀번호를 보여주는 대신 새 비밀번호를 설정하도록 바꿨다 (#37 결정, bcrypt라 원래 비밀번호는 알 수 없음).
import { useRef, useState, type FormEvent, type Ref } from "react";
import { Link } from "react-router-dom";
import { resetPassword, verifyPasswordReset } from "../api/auth";
import { getErrorMessage } from "../api/client";
import { INPUT_PATTERNS, INPUT_RULES, filterPhoneInput, toPhoneDigits } from "../api/member";
import "./FindPassword.css";

// Page-local styles from the Stitch <head>; mounted only while this page is shown.
const css =
  "body {\n      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n      background-color: #FFFDF5;\n      background-image: radial-gradient(#111111 0.75px, transparent 0.75px);\n      background-size: 20px 20px;\n      color: #111111;\n    }\n    .font-mono {\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    }\n    .brutal-border {\n      border: 2.5px solid #111111;\n    }";

const INPUT_CLASS =
  "w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 bg-white brutal-border rounded-md text-xs placeholder:text-neutral-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-0 focus:shadow-brutal-sm transition-all disabled:bg-neutral-100 disabled:text-neutral-500";
const PASSWORD_INPUT_CLASS =
  "w-full pl-3.5 pr-16 py-2.5 bg-white brutal-border rounded-md text-xs placeholder:text-neutral-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-0 focus:shadow-brutal-sm transition-all";
const ACTIVE_BUTTON =
  "bg-[#FFDE59] text-neutral-900 shadow-brutal cursor-pointer active:translate-x-[2px] active:translate-y-[2px] active:shadow-none";
const DISABLED_BUTTON = "bg-[#D9D9D9] text-neutral-500 cursor-not-allowed";

type Step = "locked" | "form" | "done";
type Notice = { tone: "idle" | "error" | "ok"; text: string };

const NOTICE_CLASS: Record<Notice["tone"], string> = {
  idle: "bg-[#E5E7EB] text-neutral-700 font-medium",
  error: "bg-red-50 text-red-700 font-bold",
  ok: "bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-bold",
};

const IDLE_NOTICE: Notice = { tone: "idle", text: "아이디와 전화번호를 입력하고 본인 확인을 눌러주세요." };

function CardHeader({
  title,
  dotClass,
  badge,
  badgeClass,
}: {
  title: string;
  dotClass: string;
  badge: string;
  badgeClass: string;
}) {
  return (
    <div className="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 mb-4 border-b-[2.5px] border-black">
      <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span className={`w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full inline-block ${dotClass}`}></span>
        <h2 className="text-base font-bold text-neutral-900">{title}</h2>
      </div>
      <span className={`px-2 py-0.5 brutal-border text-[10px] font-extrabold tracking-wider ${badgeClass}`}>
        {badge}
      </span>
    </div>
  );
}

function PasswordInput({
  id,
  label,
  value,
  onChange,
  placeholder,
  inputRef,
}: {
  id: string;
  label: string;
  value: string;
  onChange: (value: string) => void;
  placeholder: string;
  inputRef?: Ref<HTMLInputElement>;
}) {
  const [visible, setVisible] = useState(false);
  return (
    <>
      <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-neutral-800 mb-1.5" htmlFor={id}>
        {label} <span className="text-red-500">*</span>
      </label>
      <div className="relative">
        <input
          autoComplete="new-password"
          className={PASSWORD_INPUT_CLASS}
          id={id}
          maxLength={12}
          onChange={(e) => onChange(e.target.value)}
          placeholder={placeholder}
          ref={inputRef}
          type={visible ? "text" : "password"}
          value={value}
        />
        <button
          aria-label={visible ? "비밀번호 숨기기" : "비밀번호 보기"}
          className="absolute right-2 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold bg-[#FFFDF5] border-2 border-black rounded cursor-pointer"
          onClick={() => setVisible((v) => !v)}
          type="button"
        >
          {visible ? "숨기기" : "표시"}
        </button>
      </div>
    </>
  );
}

export default function FindPassword() {
  const [loginId, setLoginId] = useState("");
  const [phone, setPhone] = useState("");
  const [newPassword, setNewPassword] = useState("");
  const [confirmPassword, setConfirmPassword] = useState("");
  const [step, setStep] = useState<Step>("locked");
  const [notice, setNotice] = useState<Notice>(IDLE_NOTICE);
  const [resetError, setResetError] = useState<string | null>(null);
  const [submitting, setSubmitting] = useState(false);
  const newPasswordRef = useRef<HTMLInputElement>(null);

  const canVerify =
    step === "locked" &&
    INPUT_PATTERNS.loginId.test(loginId) &&
    INPUT_PATTERNS.phone.test(toPhoneDigits(phone)) &&
    !submitting;
  const newPasswordValid = INPUT_PATTERNS.password.test(newPassword);
  const passwordsMatch = newPasswordValid && newPassword === confirmPassword;
  const canReset = step === "form" && passwordsMatch && !submitting;

  function editAccount(setter: (value: string) => void, value: string) {
    setter(value);
    if (notice.tone === "error") setNotice(IDLE_NOTICE);
  }

  async function handleVerify(e: FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>) {
    e.preventDefault();
    if (!canVerify) return;
    setSubmitting(true);
    try {
      await verifyPasswordReset(loginId, toPhoneDigits(phone));
      setNotice({ tone: "ok", text: "✓ 본인 확인 완료 · 오른쪽에서 새 비밀번호를 설정하세요." });
      setStep("form");
      // 오른쪽 카드가 그려진 다음 새 비밀번호 칸으로 커서를 옮긴다.
      requestAnimationFrame(() => newPasswordRef.current?.focus());
    } catch (err) {
      setNotice({ tone: "error", text: getErrorMessage(err) });
    } finally {
      setSubmitting(false);
    }
  }

  async function handleReset(e: FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>) {
    e.preventDefault();
    if (!canReset) return;
    setSubmitting(true);
    setResetError(null);
    try {
      await resetPassword(loginId, toPhoneDigits(phone), newPassword);
      setStep("done");
    } catch (err) {
      setResetError(getErrorMessage(err));
    } finally {
      setSubmitting(false);
    }
  }

  const newPasswordHint =
    newPassword === ""
      ? { className: "text-neutral-500", text: INPUT_RULES.password }
      : newPasswordValid
        ? { className: "text-emerald-700", text: "사용할 수 있는 비밀번호예요." }
        : { className: "text-red-600", text: INPUT_RULES.password };

  return (
    <div id="page-find-password">
      <style>{css}</style>
      <div
        className="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between selection:bg-[#FFDE59]"
        style={{
          backgroundColor: "rgb(255, 253, 245)",
          backgroundImage: "radial-gradient(rgb(217, 212, 195) 1.2px, transparent 1.2px)",
          backgroundSize: "18px 18px",
        }}
      >
        <header className="w-full px-4 sm:px-8 py-3.5 sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white border-b-2 border-[#111111]">
          <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between">
            <Link className="flex items-center gap-1.5" to="/">
              <span className="text-2xl font-black text-[#111111] tracking-tight font-sans">Dev</span>
              <span className="bg-[#FFD43B] border-2 border-[#111111] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-lg font-mono font-bold text-[#111111] shadow-[2px_2px_0_#111111]">
                in_
              </span>
            </Link>
            <div className="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <Link
                className="px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold bg-[#FFFDF5] brutal-border shadow-brutal-sm hover:translate-x-[1px] hover:translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-none transition-all"
                to="/login"
              >
                로그인
              </Link>{" "}
              <Link
                className="px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold bg-[#FFDE59] brutal-border shadow-brutal-sm hover:translate-x-[1px] hover:translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-none transition-all"
                to="/signup"
              >
                회원가입
              </Link>
            </div>
          </div>
        </header>

        <main className="flex-1 max-w-5xl w-full mx-auto px-4 py-10 flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div className="text-center mb-9">
            <div className="inline-block mb-3.5">
              <span className="px-3 py-1 bg-[#FFFDF5] brutal-border shadow-brutal-sm text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase">
                {"Security & Account Recovery"}
              </span>
            </div>
            <h1 className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-neutral-900 mb-2.5">비밀번호 찾기</h1>
            <p className="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-600 font-medium">
              가입 시 등록한 아이디와 전화번호로 본인 확인 후 새 비밀번호를 설정할 수 있습니다.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 items-stretch">
            {/* LEFT CARD: 계정 정보 입력 + 본인 확인 */}
            <section
              className="bg-[#FFFDF5] brutal-border rounded-xl shadow-brutal p-6 flex flex-col justify-between"
              data-purpose="account-input-form"
            >
              <div>
                <div className="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 mb-5 border-b-[2.5px] border-black">
                  <h2 className="text-base font-bold text-neutral-900">계정 정보 입력</h2>
                  <span className="px-2 py-0.5 bg-[#FFFDF5] brutal-border text-[11px] font-bold shadow-brutal-sm">
                    전화번호 본인 확인
                  </span>
                </div>

                <form className="space-y-4" noValidate onSubmit={handleVerify}>
                  <div>
                    <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-neutral-800 mb-1.5" htmlFor="user-id">
                      아이디 <span className="text-red-500">*</span>
                    </label>
                    <input
                      autoComplete="username"
                      className={INPUT_CLASS}
                      disabled={step !== "locked"}
                      id="user-id"
                      maxLength={12}
                      onChange={(e) => editAccount(setLoginId, e.target.value)}
                      placeholder="아이디 입력"
                      type="text"
                      value={loginId}
                    />
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <label className="block text-xs font-bold text-neutral-800 mb-1.5" htmlFor="user-phone">
                      전화번호 <span className="text-red-500">*</span>
                    </label>
                    <input
                      autoComplete="tel"
                      className={`${INPUT_CLASS} tracking-wider`}
                      disabled={step !== "locked"}
                      id="user-phone"
                      inputMode="numeric"
                      maxLength={13}
                      onChange={(e) => editAccount(setPhone, filterPhoneInput(e.target.value))}
                      placeholder="010-0000-0000"
                      type="tel"
                      value={phone}
                    />
                  </div>

                  <div
                    aria-live="polite"
                    className={`p-3 brutal-border rounded-md text-center text-xs ${NOTICE_CLASS[notice.tone]}`}
                  >
                    {notice.text}
                  </div>

                  <div className="pt-2">
                    <button
                      className={`w-full py-2.5 brutal-border font-bold text-xs rounded transition-all ${
                        canVerify ? ACTIVE_BUTTON : DISABLED_BUTTON
                      }`}
                      disabled={!canVerify}
                      type="submit"
                    >
                      {submitting && step === "locked" ? "확인 중..." : "본인 확인"}
                    </button>
                  </div>
                </form>
              </div>

              <div className="mt-6 pt-4 border-t-[1.5px] border-neutral-300 text-center">
                <p className="text-[11px] font-semibold text-neutral-600 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap">
                  <Link className="hover:text-black hover:underline" to="/find-id">
                    아이디 찾기
                  </Link>{" "}
                  <span className="text-neutral-400">|</span>{" "}
                  <Link className="hover:text-black hover:underline" to="/signup">
                    회원가입
                  </Link>{" "}
                  <span className="text-neutral-400">|</span>{" "}
                  <Link className="hover:text-black hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-0.5" to="/login">
                    로그인으로 돌아가기 →
                  </Link>
                </p>
              </div>
            </section>

            {/* RIGHT CARD: 본인 확인 전(잠김) → 새 비밀번호 입력 → 변경 완료 */}
            <section
              className="bg-[#FFFDF5] brutal-border rounded-xl shadow-brutal p-6 flex flex-col justify-between"
              data-purpose="password-reset-card"
            >
              {step === "locked" && (
                <div className="flex flex-col h-full">
                  <CardHeader
                    badge="LOCKED"
                    badgeClass="bg-[#E5E7EB]"
                    dotClass="bg-neutral-300 border-2 border-black"
                    title="새 비밀번호 설정"
                  />
                  <div className="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center py-10 gap-3">
                    <div className="w-12 h-12 brutal-border rounded-full bg-white shadow-brutal-sm flex items-center justify-center text-xl">
                      🔒
                    </div>
                    <p className="text-xs font-bold">왼쪽에서 본인 확인을 먼저 해주세요.</p>
                    <p className="text-[11px] text-neutral-500 font-medium">
                      아이디와 가입할 때 등록한 전화번호가 일치하면
                      <br />새 비밀번호를 설정할 수 있어요.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              )}

              {step === "form" && (
                <form className="flex flex-col h-full justify-between" noValidate onSubmit={handleReset}>
                  <div>
                    <CardHeader
                      badge="VERIFIED"
                      badgeClass="bg-[#FFDE59] shadow-brutal-sm"
                      dotClass="bg-black"
                      title="새 비밀번호 설정"
                    />
                    <p className="text-xs text-neutral-600 mb-4 font-medium">
                      본인 확인이 완료되었습니다. 사용할 새 비밀번호를 입력해주세요.
                    </p>
                    <div className="space-y-4">
                      <div>
                        <PasswordInput
                          id="new-password"
                          inputRef={newPasswordRef}
                          label="새 비밀번호"
                          onChange={setNewPassword}
                          placeholder="8~12자, 영문·숫자·_ . -"
                          value={newPassword}
                        />
                        <p className={`mt-1 text-[11px] font-semibold ${newPasswordHint.className}`}>
                          {newPasswordHint.text}
                        </p>
                      </div>
                      <div>
                        <PasswordInput
                          id="new-password-confirm"
                          label="새 비밀번호 확인"
                          onChange={setConfirmPassword}
                          placeholder="한 번 더 입력"
                          value={confirmPassword}
                        />
                        {confirmPassword !== "" && (
                          <p
                            className={`mt-1 text-[11px] font-semibold ${passwordsMatch ? "text-emerald-700" : "text-red-600"}`}
                          >
                            {passwordsMatch ? "비밀번호가 일치해요." : "비밀번호가 일치하지 않습니다."}
                          </p>
                        )}
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div className="space-y-2.5 mt-6">
                    {resetError && (
                      <p className="text-xs font-bold text-red-600 text-center" role="alert">
                        {resetError}
                      </p>
                    )}
                    <button
                      className={`w-full py-2.5 brutal-border font-bold text-xs rounded transition-all ${
                        canReset ? ACTIVE_BUTTON : DISABLED_BUTTON
                      }`}
                      disabled={!canReset}
                      type="submit"
                    >
                      {submitting ? "변경 중..." : "비밀번호 변경"}
                    </button>
                    <Link
                      className="block w-full py-2.5 text-center bg-[#FFFDF5] hover:bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-900 brutal-border shadow-brutal-sm font-bold text-xs rounded transition-all"
                      to="/find-id"
                    >
                      아이디 찾기
                    </Link>
                  </div>
                </form>
              )}

              {step === "done" && (
                <div className="flex flex-col h-full justify-between">
                  <div>
                    <CardHeader
                      badge="DONE"
                      badgeClass="bg-emerald-200 shadow-brutal-sm"
                      dotClass="bg-emerald-600 border-2 border-black"
                      title="비밀번호 변경 완료"
                    />
                    <div className="brutal-border rounded-lg p-5 bg-white shadow-brutal-sm text-center space-y-2">
                      <div className="text-2xl">✅</div>
                      <p className="text-sm font-black">비밀번호가 변경되었습니다.</p>
                      <p className="text-[11px] text-neutral-600 font-medium">
                        새 비밀번호로 다시 로그인해주세요.
                        <br />
                        다른 기기에서 로그인된 상태도 함께 로그아웃됩니다.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div className="space-y-2.5 mt-6">
                    <Link
                      className="block w-full py-2.5 text-center bg-[#FFDE59] text-neutral-900 brutal-border shadow-brutal font-bold text-xs rounded transition-all active:translate-x-[2px] active:translate-y-[2px] active:shadow-none"
                      to="/login"
                    >
                      로그인하러 가기 →
                    </Link>
                  </div>
                </div>
              )}
            </section>
          </div>
        </main>

        <footer className="w-full bg-[#FFFDF5] border-t-[2.5px] border-black py-4 px-4 text-center mt-12">
          <p className="text-xs font-bold text-neutral-600">© 2025 Dev in_. All rights reserved.</p>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}
